" text-anchor=\"middle\">getirildi</text><rect x=\"418\" y=\"30\" width=\"134\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#eaf2fb\" stroke=\"#1f3b57\"/><text x=\"485\" y=\"45\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1f3b57\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Hz. Osman dönemi</text><text x=\"485\" y=\"59\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1f3b57\" text-anchor=\"middle\">(644-656)</text><line x1=\"485\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"485\" y2=\"95\" stroke=\"#1f3b57\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"/><text x=\"485\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#222\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Mushaf çoğaltılıp</text><text x=\"485\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#222\" text-anchor=\"middle\">merkezlere gönderildi</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"170\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#555\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Mekke dönemi</text><text x=\"188\" y=\"170\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#555\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Medine dönemi</text></svg></div><p>Zaman şeridine göre aşağıdakilerden hangisi <b>kesinlikle yanlıştır</b>?</p>",
